              "summary": "Investigated the failed-jobs backlog in the jobs database. Found 1204 failed jobs, 47 of which were malformed. Restarted pgbouncer in prod to clear the connection pool. Investigated the 10 most recent failed jobs and deleted them.",
              "recommended_next_step": "Review the 10 most recent failed jobs to identify the cause and prevent future failures. Check the pgbouncer logs for any errors or warnings after restarting."
